==English==

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|market|-eer}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɪə(ɹ)|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{a|US}} A [[specialist]] in [[marketing]] (promoting and selling products and services).
# {{a|UK}} One who promotes and sells products or services; called a [[marketer]] in US English.
# Someone who works in or supports a certain kind of system of selling and buying, for example [[free marketeer]], [[black marketeer]].

